   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Lesson: the standard is useful BECAUSE change is controlled. A standard that anyone can change without asking is not a standard.\n(Nobody may quietly make containers one inch wider: some crane somewhere will jam.)",
   "originalText": "Lesson: the standard is useful BECAUSE change is controlled. A standard that anyone can change without asking is not a standard.\n(Nobody may quietly make containers one inch wider: some crane somewhere will jam.)",
