   "text": "1. Independent deploys\ningest-api ships on its schedule, consumer-sink\non another, a future analytics consumer on a\nthird.\nThey never all change at the same instant.",
   "originalText": "1. Independent deploys\ningest-api ships on its schedule, consumer-sink\non another, a future analytics consumer on a\nthird.\nThey never all change at the same instant.",
