   "text": "2. Rolling upgrades\nEven ONE service runs old and new instances\ntogether during a rollout. Two producer\nversions write the same topic; two consumer\nversions read it.",
   "originalText": "2. Rolling upgrades\nEven ONE service runs old and new instances\ntogether during a rollout. Two producer\nversions write the same topic; two consumer\nversions read it.",
