   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "At any moment MANY schema versions are in flight, written by one set of programs and read by another. \"Just update both sides\" is impossible:\nthere is no instant when both sides are updated.\nEvery \"who reads what\" arrow is a compatibility question. Schema management answers them with RULES instead of coordination meetings.",
   "originalText": "At any moment MANY schema versions are in flight, written by one set of programs and read by another. \"Just update both sides\" is impossible:\nthere is no instant when both sides are updated.\nEvery \"who reads what\" arrow is a compatibility question. Schema management answers them with RULES instead of coordination meetings.",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "el00194",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
