   "text": "UNENFORCED AT THE\nBOUNDARY\n\nNothing stops the producer\nsending eventId or omitting\ntenant_id. The consumer finds out\nat runtime: a poison message.",
   "originalText": "UNENFORCED AT THE\nBOUNDARY\n\nNothing stops the producer\nsending eventId or omitting\ntenant_id. The consumer finds out\nat runtime: a poison message.",
