   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Asymmetry: CHEAP TO BREAK, EXPENSIVE TO REPAIR.  Redeploying the producer does not remove the bad records already written.\nSo the strongest defence is a GATE BEFORE PUBLISHING, not detection after.",
   "originalText": "Asymmetry: CHEAP TO BREAK, EXPENSIVE TO REPAIR.  Redeploying the producer does not remove the bad records already written.\nSo the strongest defence is a GATE BEFORE PUBLISHING, not detection after.",
