   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "AT WRITE TIME\nThe default is not for the writer. The producer must still supply a\nvalue for every field (or its library applies the default when building the\nrecord). The bytes ALWAYS contain every writer-schema field.",
   "originalText": "AT WRITE TIME\nThe default is not for the writer. The producer must still supply a\nvalue for every field (or its library applies the default when building the\nrecord). The bytes ALWAYS contain every writer-schema field.",
