   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why this choice\n\nIt isolates what you are learning\n(envelope evolution rules) from the\nunrelated problem of typing\nfree-form tenant data.\n\nWrite this boundary down in your\nnotes.",
   "originalText": "Why this choice\n\nIt isolates what you are learning\n(envelope evolution rules) from the\nunrelated problem of typing\nfree-form tenant data.\n\nWrite this boundary down in your\nnotes.",
